  /* The 挿絵 (illustration) on/off control inside 表示調整 is an <img> — a raster
     GIF of the whole button, so no colour rule can reach it and both audits walk
     past it. Its OFF state (novelview_off.gif, "挿絵を表示") is a solid WHITE pill
     that glares on the dark panel; the ON state is already a mid-grey pressed chip
     that reads fine, so invert ONLY the off variant. hue-rotate keeps the pill's
     pale-blue edge blue instead of the brown a bare inversion produces, and 0.92
     lands the fill on the page base rather than pure black. */
  img.js-adjust-layout-illustflag[src*="novelview_off"] {
