  /* The legacy sidebar headings (サイト案内 / ヘルプ) bullet themselves with a
     19x19 raster help.gif — a WHITE rounded square. It cannot be recoloured,
     so it flashed two white chips down the dark sidebar. Swap in a matching
     amber "?" chip and pin every background component: the site's shorthand
     leaves background-size at `auto`, which an override would resolve against
     the SVG rather than the gif. */
  .h2_help {
    background-image: url("data:image/svg+xml;charset=utf8,%3Csvg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' width='19' height='19' viewBox='0 0 19 19'%3E%3Crect x='0.75' y='0.75' width='17.5' height='17.5' rx='3' fill='%2321262d' stroke='%23e6c9a8' stroke-width='1.5'/%3E%3Ctext x='9.5' y='14' font-family='sans-serif' font-size='12' font-weight='bold' fill='%23e6c9a8' text-anchor='middle'%3E?%3C/text%3E%3C/svg%3E") !important;
    background-repeat: no-repeat !important;
    background-position: 0% 50% !important;
    background-size: 19px 19px !important;
  }

  /* The search-builder CTAs (検索ワードを選択 / ジャンル選択 / 詳細条件設定 /
     検索履歴 and the 検索 submit) are the site's brand-blue #2babff buttons.
     The generic button rule flattened all six to the same neutral chip, so the
     page's primary action stopped looking like one. `#trad a` (an ID) outranks
